{"id":234574896456983,"type":"artist","name":"The S.O.S. Band","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":10,"info":{"img":"https://cdn-images.dzcdn.net/images/artist/203d3f2416cb87935f269e6ccd1f6c52/1000x1000-000000-80-0-0.jpg","bio":"S.O.S. Band se formó en Atlanta en 1977. El primer single del grupo de R&B, \"Take Your Time (Do It Right)\", fue directamente disco de platino y les allanó el camino para su LP de debut \"S.O.S (Sounds Of Success)\", que fue disco de oro. Establecida ya, la banda firmó con el sello Tabu y empezó a colaborar con el compositor y productor Sigidi Abdullah. Tuvieron muchos hits en la década de los 80. El grupo lo componían originalmente Mary Davis (voz, teclados), Jason TC Bryant (teclados), Billy R.","tags":["funk","soul","Disco","80s","rnb"]},"works":[{"id":143057240045050,"type":"album","name":"S.O.S.","artist":"The S.O.S. Band","year":1980,"weight":11,"yt":"FSaCaZ4qHcQ","src":"books,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Funk","title":"Funk: The Music, the People, and the Rhythm of the One (Rickey Vincent)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":94986022996747,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Boogie","rank":44,"scaruffi":null},{"id":200368112062640,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Disco","rank":178,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":2}},{"id":106597494351458,"type":"song","name":"Take Your Time","artist":"The S.O.S. Band","year":1980,"weight":2,"yt":null,"src":"charts","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":132335824845498,"name":"Billboard Year-End Hot 100","rank":37,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":169523605600386,"type":"song","name":"Take Your Time (Do It Right)","artist":"The S.O.S. Band","year":1980,"weight":2,"yt":"LUa5t8ESM-4","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":221747517087883,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1980","rank":37,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":278478119532515,"type":"album","name":"S.O.S. Band III","artist":"S.O.S. Band","year":1982,"weight":7,"yt":"FSaCaZ4qHcQ","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[